{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34311","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 五 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"福地能容壍，玄关讵有扉。\n静思琼版字，闲洗铁筇衣。\n鸟破凉烟下，人冲暮雨归。\n故园秋草梦，犹记绿微微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}